        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo Aroni waka cita obo: wakatandabika ijanza lyakwe amusako wakwe, wauma bulongo bwacisi, nkabela bwakasanduka kuba mansenya akati kabantu aakati kabanyama. Bulongo boonse bwacisi bwakaba mansenya mucisi coonse ca-Egepita. ",
