        {
          "text": "Mpawo basimabibo bakaambila Farao kuti, Ngooyu munwe wa-Leza. Pele moyo wa-Farao wakayumisigwa, wakaka kubaswiilila, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakaamba.",
