                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova wakacita obo. Kwakasika matanga mapati aamazi muŋanda ya-Farao amumaanda aabalanda bakwe. Mucisi coonse ca-Egepita nyika yakanyonyooka nkaambo kamazi.",
          "type": "text",
