                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova wakacita mbubonya mbwaakaamba Musa. Wakagwisya matanga aamazi kuzwa kuli-Farao akubalanda bakwe akubantu bakwe. Taakwe neliba lyomwe lyakasyaala. ",
